{"publicId":"37ac2b98-8d8a-4551-9842-64e1f3f698b3","title":"HIVE Digital Technologies 修正 AI 云计算合同金额至 2.25 亿美元","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-12T15:30:21.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-12T15:30:21.000Z","digest":"HIVE Digital Technologies 在 2026-11-12 02:13 宣布签署价值约 600 万美元的 AI 云计算合同，包含与 Bell AI Fabric 的 2250 万美元三年期协议和匿名投资级企业 3500 万美元五年期合作。但同日 23:30 更新报道显示，其与 Bell AI Fabric 的合同实际金额为 2.25 亿美元（原报道误写为 2250 万美元），并补充该合作预计为 HIVE 年营收贡献 7500 万美元/年。早先报道中 600 万美元总金额与具体子合同金额存在矛盾，后续修正后仅保留 Bell AI Fabric 的 2.25 亿美元三年期合同信息，匿名企业合作部分未在跟进报道中更新。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-12T17:41:43.508Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"HIVE Digital Technologies 与 Bell AI Fabric 签订 2.25 亿美元 GPU 云服务三年合同","latestReport":{"id":"ruhznar56zvpnpvow25p6pxyj"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":false,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fuHsOf95yaew","title":"HIVE Digital Technologies与Bell AI Fabric签署三年GPU云合同","firstReportAt":"2026-11-12T15:30:21.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"ruhznar56zvpnpvow25p6pxyj","title":"HIVE Digital Technologies 与 Bell AI Fabric 签订 2.25 亿美元 GPU 云服务三年合同","summary":"HIVE Digital Technologies 与 Bell AI Fabric 签订价值 2.25 亿美元的三年 GPU 云服务合同，预计年营收 7500 万美元。","source":{"name":"Crypto Briefing","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T15:30:21.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"ruhznar56zvpnpvow25p6pxyj","title":"HIVE Digital Technologies 与 Bell AI Fabric 签订 2.25 亿美元 GPU 云服务三年合同","summary":"HIVE Digital Technologies 与 Bell AI Fabric 签订价值 2.25 亿美元的三年 GPU 云服务合同，预计年营收 7500 万美元。","source":{"name":"Crypto Briefing","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T15:30:21.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-11T20:00:00.000Z","heat":9.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T21:00:00.000Z","heat":9.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T22:00:00.000Z","heat":9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T23:00:00.000Z","heat":8.7,"parti